{"tool_name":"r-wrassp","contents":["biocontainers","oeb"],"fetched_metadata":{"biocontainers":{"name":"r-wrassp","identifiers":[],"license":"GPL (>= 3)","summary":"A wrapper around Michel Scheffers libassp (<http://libassp.sourceforge.net/>). The libassp (Advanced Speech Signal Processor) library aims at providing functionality for handling speech signal files in most common audio formats and for performing analyses common in phonetic science/speech science. This includes the calculation of formants, fundamental frequency, root mean square, auto correlation, a variety of spectral analyses, zero crossing rate, filtering etc. This wrapper provides R with a large subset of libassp signal processing functions and provides them to the user in a (hopefully) user-friendly manner.","home_url":"https://github.com/IPS-LMU/wrassp","keywords":[],"manually_check":true,"total_pulls":0},"oeb":{"metrics":[{"@id":"https://openebench.bsc.es/monitor/metrics/bioconda:r-wrassp:0.1.4/cmd/github.com","@license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/","@nmsp":"bioconda","@type":"metrics","distribution":{"binaries":{"freeness":null,"registration":null},"packages":true,"source_packages":false,"sourcecode":{"free":null,"interpreted":null,"license":null,"public":true,"readme":false,"repository":{"anonymous":null,"online":null}}},"project":{"build":{},"deployment":{},"license":{"open_source":false,"osi":false},"publications":[],"readme":false,"summary":{"description":true},"website":{"bioschemas":true,"copyright":false,"https":true,"license":false,"operational":200,"ssl":true,"ssl_err":null}},"support":{"issue_tracking":{"public_tracker":null,"resolve_time":null}}},{"@id":"https://openebench.bsc.es/monitor/metrics/r-wrassp","@license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/","@nmsp":null,"@type":"metrics","distribution":{"binaries":{"freeness":null,"registration":null},"packages":null,"source_packages":false,"sourcecode":{"free":null,"interpreted":null,"license":null,"public":true